{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/90c14edb4e1691a6b4a9e4ee80d38154.poster.avif?t=1768551680\" width=800 height=533 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/90c14edb4e1691a6b4a9e4ee80d38154.webm?t=1768551680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Engine is a survival action-roguelike where players explore a post-apocalyptic city overrun by intelligent zombie threats.\u00a0Each choice to fight or flee impacts survival as zombies actively track, adapt, and work together to hunt their prey. Loot critical items and manage your expandable backpack every item could mean the difference between life and death.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hand-Drawn Pixel Environment and Survival Tactics</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our post-apocalyptic world comes alive through hand-drawn pixel art, where every corner of the carefully crafted maps holds strategic potential. Plan your escape routes, set clever traps, and transform city ruins into deadly obstacles. Your survival depends on how well you use the terrain against the zombie hordes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/9c77f5bf823e3c7305d7256802965488.poster.avif?t=1768551680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/9c77f5bf823e3c7305d7256802965488.webm?t=1768551680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Future of Your Camp is in Your Hands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some survivors will want to join your camp and improve your chances of survival, but you cannot know who will turn into a zombie as they may hide it from you. Be careful and check everyone at the gate. Others may not want to join but still seek to trade, so listen to their requests carefully. By selling them items they desperately need, you will not only earn more scrap but also uncover their haunting survival stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/4f3d84540ecd84c8995d2891a1d177f3.poster.avif?t=1768551680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/4f3d84540ecd84c8995d2891a1d177f3.webm?t=1768551680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/4f3d84540ecd84c8995d2891a1d177f3.mp4?t=1768551680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Advanced Zombie AI</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies in Dead Engine think, adapt, and hunt as a collective threat. Our unique pathfinding system enables them to intelligently move through the city, adjusting their routes based on your position. When they spot others nearby, they merge into dangerous hunting hordes. Ranged zombies bring another layer of challenge - they'll keep their distance while attacking and launch acid bombs over structures if you try to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/2a7629f0e9fe6ac01fb022283c33529a.poster.avif?t=1768551680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/2a7629f0e9fe6ac01fb022283c33529a.webm?t=1768551680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Expandable Backpack and Inventory Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find backpacks and expand them to carry more items. Merge items to free up space and customize your backpack to match your playstyle while exploring the city and fighting zombies. A well-upgraded backpack can be the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/81f65882c5ce14cef0bfe6d50bdb9db0.poster.avif?t=1768551680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/81f65882c5ce14cef0bfe6d50bdb9db0.webm?t=1768551680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unique Characters and Journeys</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the map, characters await for your paths to cross but only if you can follow their traces. Each encounter offers a new perspective and a different way to survive. Explore, connect, and remember: you're not alone in this dangerous world. And when you discover a character, you\u2019ll unlock the ability to play as them. Every meeting takes you deeper into the city, and into yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/5f012405685af574333dd85bb2897269.poster.avif?t=1768551680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/extras/5f012405685af574333dd85bb2897269.webm?t=1768551680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense 10-20 Minute Survival Runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camp Management System<strong>:</strong> Control who enters your camp: accept, reject, or kill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Zombie AI with Dynamic Horde Behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Crafted Pixel Art Environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Environment with Strategic Traps and Defensive Turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory Management System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mergeable Items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expandable Backpack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Building &amp; Trading System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Survivor Stories to Uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Playable Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Progression System  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3234100?t=1768551680","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/cf85492134a26504c1647762d6a9d5548a48cf64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768551680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/1afbddced53e1a0d09dbbc175b2ec466bf3bdbbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768551680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234100/1afbddced53e1a0d09dbbc175b2ec466bf3bdbbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768551680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family 